I'm going to have to make a list before I do the groceries too. No more impulse buying."}, {"time": "46500", "image": "engenn6le11ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "I've stuck pictures of tantalizing low fat foods on my fridge. I downloaded a \u2018healthy foods' app online. I haven't got anything to lose but those few extra pounds."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le11ob10re2img02.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le11ob10re2aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Living Longer Better"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Good Life"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le11ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Health Advice and Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can offer advice and solutions to people on how to improve their health or longevity. <br><br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">You should ...</span> </li><li><span class=\"italic\">You need to ...</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">You ought to ...</span> (strong request) </li><li><span class=\"italic\">You had better ... </span>(strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you say what is necessary to follow advice, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span>, or <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>. <br><span class=\"italic\">Have got to</span> focuses on now and in the future. <span class=\"italic\">Going to have to,</span> focuses on the future alone. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Advice and Solutions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Saying What is Necessary\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My doctor said I ought to cut back on the sweets.</span> <br><br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I had better get a lunch back to put it in.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to have to choose my foods more carefully.</span> <br> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">So,the cheesecake at lunch has got to go.</span> <br><br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've got to start packing my lunch. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tempting"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "attractive; appealing even if not good for you "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those pastries look tempting!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about healthy eating."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pastry "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sweet cake or sweet bread with a filling "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I never eat pastries!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glorious "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "memorable; beautiful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at that glorious cake!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tantalizing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing desire and excitement  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vegetables could never be called tantalizing!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stress"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to emphasize "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He stressed that I should eat better."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "insulated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "protected to keep something warm or cool  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need an insulated lunch bag."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "impulse"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sudden strong feeling "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: No more impulse buying!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to download"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put into a computer's memory "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I downloaded an app on healthy food choices."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stick"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to glue; to fix to "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I stuck some pictures on my fridge. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob10aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cut 10 index cards in half."}, {"type": "text", "content": "On one side paste or draw a picture of a food you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "On the other side, write the word or words for the food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do a mixture of fruit, vegetables and dishes you enjoy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take your cards to class."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying the words with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write names for 20 foods on 1 side of a card."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I paste or draw a picture of the food on the other side."}]}]}